OL,3,APope Francis' diary reveals claims he
OL,4,Asaw the devil three times
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Francis claimed he saw the devil
OL,7,Fthree times over the course of his
OL,8,Flife, as well as the "gates of hell",
OL,9,Faccording to new extracts from his
OL,10,Fprivate diary.
OL,12,FIn The Private Diary of Pope Francis,
OL,13,Fpublished on Tuesday, a 2021 entry
OL,14,Flists the late pontiff as having three
OL,15,Fvisions of the devil: once from a car,
OL,16,Fanother "in the choir loft" during
OL,17,FMass, and a third during a meeting with
OL,18,FVatican officials.
OL,20,F"I can't forget the powerful raspiness
OL,21,Fof his voice," Francis wrote, recalling
OL,22,Fone of the visions.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
