OL,3,APope Francis' diary reveals claims he
OL,4,Asaw the devil three times
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the diary, written from 1992 to
OL,7,F2024, he also expresses regret over his
OL,8,F2018 visit to Chile, when he was
OL,9,Fcriticised for defending a bishop who
OL,10,Fwas accused of covering up sexual abuse
OL,11,Fcommitted by a priest.
